TITLE H2SO4 additions to pure water (pH 7)
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 25
    pH   7 charge
    pe   4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1

REACTION 1
    H2SO4 1
    0.001 0.005 0.01 0.05 0.1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file acid_steps.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -totals S(6)

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step_mol_H2SO4
    10 PUNCH RXN
END
